0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
54. 680.3899999999999864 Td
(The production release features a decoupled architecture: a high-responsiveness Next.js 16 \(React 19\) frontend) Tj
T* (deployed on Vercel, a high-throughput Python FastAPI microservice deployed on Railway for heavy PDF processing,) Tj
T* (Neon Serverless PostgreSQL for scalable persistence, Clerk for resilient multi-session authentication, and Google) Tj
T* (Gemini API for fast, cost-effective reasoning within a $5-$10/month operational budget.) Tj
